{title: I can go in to the Holy of Holies}
{x_theme: worship}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/I can go into the Holy of Holies.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I can go into the Holy of Holies
I can kneel and make my petitions known
I can go into the Holy of Holies
Although I’m just a common man
Because of God’s redemption plan
I can boldly approach the throne
